gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Oh good, the build booted.\p"
	.string "Welcome to POKéMON EMERALD:\n"
	.string "AI SLOP.\p"
	.string "I'm DR. PATCH, prototype lead.\p"
	.string "The lab shipped generated monsters\n"
	.string "before QA could stop us.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what management calls\n"
	.string "a “minimum viable POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is now crawling with\n"
	.string "prompt artifacts, vibe-coded bugs,\l"
	.string "and compressed video mistakes.\p"
	.string "They look wrong, but the battle\n"
	.string "engine accepts them, so we're live.\p"
	.string "I study why prototypes keep\n"
	.string "escaping the repo.\p"
	.string "Please ignore the obvious seams.\n"
	.string "That's just the creative direction.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Before the demo eats your\n"
	.string "save, who are you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Pick your tester.\n"
	.string "Vibe coder, or actual coder?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "Cool.\n"
	.string "What name goes in the\n"
	.string "bug report?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So the bug report says\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Right, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
	.string "You're the new playtester moving\n"
	.string "into our Littleroot test branch.\p"
	.string "Perfect. We needed someone who\n"
	.string "hadn't read the known issues.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Ready?\p"
	.string "The first ten minutes should work.\n"
	.string "After that, no promises.\p"
	.string "Go meet the prototypes, catch the\n"
	.string "footage, and try not to softlock.\p"
	.string "I'll be in the lab pretending this\n"
	.string "was always the product vision.\p"
	.string "$"
